My last two ascensions i've gotten to the castle without reflection.
Not fun, mind you, but doable. Ways in which you can get reflection
- wish (magic lamp, wand, fountain, smoky potion)
- sokoban
- find a silver dragon and be able to kill it
- find an amulet of reflection and ID it
- find a shield of reflection (instantly recognizable by description)
- be a ranger and get the quest artifact
- medusa level has a good chance of giving you reflection
- kill an angel who happens to be wearing a shield of reflection
- and maybe more ways?

Okay, so you've run into a black dragon without reflection, what do
you do:
- stop!
- think!
- try to get it into melee range before it has the ability to use it's
breath
- if you can spare the impact on your AC, remove important armor that
may get destroyed
- make sure you have as much armor an as you can (as far as pieces
go). Even if that dwavish cloak you have won't give you any benefit at
all, put it on as disintegration will always take armor over your
life.
- use a wand of cancellation if you have one
- run away! (dig down and come back later, teleport the dragon away,
teleport yourself away, etc)

